1+<035>-------+-----+--------------------------------------------------+
 | 2022-12-31 | 295 | General:                                         |
 |            |     | - add '-*' and 'V*' types                        |
 |            |     | - move 'VPor' after 'Por'                        |
 |            |     | - merge "Invite" and "Other" pickup types        |
